  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to DNDi to discover, develop, and deliver treatments for the most neglected populations.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to improve accessibility to medical products and drive innovation based on global health needs by developing an &#x2018;end-to-end&#x2019; approach to drug R&amp;D, from discovery and preclinical research to clinical trials and delivery, bringing new treatments to the most-neglected patients.</narrative>
  </description>
